==Event Information==
{{Color|#FF0000|'''Crash Fever'''}} & The Battle Cats team up for a thrilling collab event!<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''On between November 1st and 22nd, 2018!'''}}

{{Color|#FF0000|'''●Crash Fever Collab Capsules!'''}}<br>
Only for a short time, Crash Fever collab capsules are available in The Battle Cats!<br>
[[Mobius (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF00CC|'''MOBIUS (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Massive damage to Red enemies, with 100% knockback!<br>
[[Belial (Super Rare Cat)|{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''BELIAL (Super Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Gets much stronger as he takes damage!<br>
<small><small>※ Both the Crash Fever limited edition units and normal Rare Capsule units may be received from draws at the Collab Capsules, but Crash Fever units cannot be received from any other Rare Capsule set. Tap the Capsule Set select icons at the top of the Rare Capsule screen to select Crash Fever if you want to get a limited edition unit!<br>
※ The First-Time Discount does not apply to Crash Fever collab capsules.<br>
※ If Crash Fever capsule set content does not appear, make sure that you have a strong network connection are updated to the most recent version of The Battle Cats.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF0000|'''●Crash Fever Special Stages!'''}}<br>
Take the plunge into a vibrant virtual kingdom!<br>
The stars of Crash Fever appear as enemies determined to defeat the Cat Army!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''●Returning Crash Fever Collab Stages'''}}<br>
Visit the Stories of Legend / Event Stages to select the limited edition collab map {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''Gates of ALICE!'''}}<br>
Three days after the collab starts {{Color|#FF00CC|'''(November 4th (0:00~))'''}}, the next special map, {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''Moonlit City'''}}, will also appear!<br>
This time around, returning stages have received an upgrade - try out the increased difficulty on the added {{Color|#008000|'''2-Star'''}} and {{Color|#008000|'''3-Star'''}} challenges!

{{Color|#008000|'''●ALL NEW Crash Fever Collab Stage'''}}<br>
Are you tough enough to conquer the newest Crash Fever map, {{Color|#008000|'''Queen Rampant'''}}? These stages will be available throughout the campaign. Pick up tons of XP as a reward on Stage Clear!<br>
Clear any stage on either of these maps to receive Timed Score rewards, and {{Color|#FF00CC|'''30 Cat Food'''}} when you clear all stages on a map. These stages are only available for a short time, so don't miss out on your chance to take on these special challenges!<br>
<small><small>※ If Crash Fever special event stages do not appear, make sure that you have a strong network connection are updated to the most recent version of The Battle Cats.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Special Missions in the Catnip Challenges!'''}}<br>
Collect limited-time mission rewards by completing Crash Fever stages!<br>
Once you've met the requirements, head to the Catnip Challenges and accept your prizes!<br>
<small><small>※These Special missions can only be completed until November 22nd at 11:00am, so don't forget to claim your rewards before then!</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Login daily to earn items and a Rare Ticket!'''}}<br>
Every day you visit the Cat Base menu during this campaign, you will pick up a {{Color|#FF00CC|'''15 Cat Food'''}} reward! Log in every day and collect all the bonus Cat Food!

Visit the official site below for more info about Crash Fever!<br>
https://www.facebook.com/CrashFeverEN/

